    {
      "title": "NASA TechLeap Prize: Orbital Clarity Challenge",
      "link": "https://www.nasa.gov/directorates/stmd/prizes-challenges-crowdsourcing-program/nasa-techleap-prize-orbital-clarity-challenge/",
      "description": "The Orbital Clarity Challenge — the sixth in the NASA TechLeap Prize series — is a collaborative effort between NASA’s&#160;Heliophysics Division,&#160;Flight Opportunities program, and&#160;Center of Excellence for Collaborative Innovation.&#160;The Heliophysics Division studies space weather, including how it heats and expands Earth’s outer atmosphere during intense solar activity, creating orbital drag through atmospheric density changes. The [&#8230;]",
